# Input
```html
<!-- should generate diagnostics -->
<div><li>Item in a div</li></div>
<ul><div><li>Indirect child</li></div></ul>
<ol><section><li>Indirect child</li></section></ol>
<menu><div><li>Indirect child</li></div></menu>
<dl><li>Not a description list item</li></dl>
<div><Li>Mixed case item</Li></div>
<div><li /></div>

```

